1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,264
Hey, I'm Clement,
an AI avatar.

2
00:00:02,314 --> 00:00:04,565
We're building your
Graduation party 2027

3
00:00:04,615 --> 00:00:06,757
website with AI, and
you help shape it.

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:09,239
And I'm Casey,
also an AI avatar.

5
00:00:09,289 --> 00:00:11,098
A few questions are
coming up where you

6
00:00:11,148 --> 00:00:11,795
get to decide.

7
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:13,015
Let's start with signing in.

8
00:00:13,065 --> 00:00:15,693
The plan: your email
address, no password.

9
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:17,393
You type your email
address into the

10
00:00:17,443 --> 00:00:17,751
portal.

11
00:00:17,801 --> 00:00:20,103
You get an email
with a link.

12
00:00:20,153 --> 00:00:23,466
Tap it, and the portal
knows the address

13
00:00:23,516 --> 00:00:24,286
is yours.

14
00:00:24,336 --> 00:00:24,697
Email, link, done.

15
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,657
Next, the editor, your tool.

16
00:00:26,707 --> 00:00:28,159
No coding needed.

17
00:00:28,209 --> 00:00:30,837
One finger is enough,
ideally on an iPad.

18
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,140
On the left are
building blocks, like a

19
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:35,363
heading, text, a
photo or a countdown.

20
00:00:35,413 --> 00:00:37,516
Tap one and drag it
where you want it.

21
00:00:37,566 --> 00:00:38,340
Don't like it?

22
00:00:38,389 --> 00:00:39,305
Drag it away again.

23
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,366
Important: whatever
you build is only a

24
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:42,328
proposal at first.

25
00:00:42,378 --> 00:00:44,183
It goes online only
when the deciding

26
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:45,648
group, the
committee, agrees.

27
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,709
Don't feel like typing?

28
00:00:46,759 --> 00:00:48,914
Tell the AI helper
what to build, for

29
00:00:48,964 --> 00:00:50,654
example: make
the page green.

30
00:00:50,704 --> 00:00:52,271
You see the
proposal right away.

31
00:00:52,321 --> 00:00:53,987
It goes online only
when the committee

32
00:00:54,037 --> 00:00:54,559
approves it.

33
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,504
Three AI helpers
build with us.

34
00:00:56,554 --> 00:00:58,936
Salt, the Quality
Bot, checks quality

35
00:00:58,986 --> 00:01:01,303
every ten minutes
and has 79 skills.

36
00:01:01,370 --> 00:01:03,625
Pepper, the Response
Bot, looks into the

37
00:01:03,675 --> 00:01:06,042
inbox every ten minutes
and has 54 skills.

38
00:01:06,130 --> 00:01:08,516
And Chili, the
Security and Litigation

39
00:01:08,566 --> 00:01:11,014
Bot, watches over
privacy and copyright

40
00:01:11,064 --> 00:01:13,200
around the clock,
with 133 skills.

41
00:01:13,290 --> 00:01:15,490
Now something to join
in: the profile card

42
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:16,170
or portrait.

43
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,151
One kid can be
described by another,

44
00:01:18,201 --> 00:01:20,186
kindly and with only
positive things.

45
00:01:20,290 --> 00:01:21,177
Here's how it works.

46
00:01:21,227 --> 00:01:23,385
One: a kid writes
about another.

47
00:01:23,435 --> 00:01:26,263
Two: anything mean is
stopped right away.

48
00:01:26,313 --> 00:01:28,382
Three: the person
described sees the text

49
00:01:28,432 --> 00:01:30,098
first, alone, and
can improve it.

50
00:01:30,148 --> 00:01:33,232
Four: they decide
whether it appears, and

51
00:01:33,282 --> 00:01:35,769
under 16 their
parents agree too.

52
00:01:35,819 --> 00:01:37,093
They get the final say.

53
00:01:37,143 --> 00:01:39,238
Without their yes,
everything is deleted

54
00:01:39,288 --> 00:01:40,022
after 30 days.

55
00:01:40,090 --> 00:01:43,430
Two examples: Louis,
15, likes extra spicy

56
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,874
kebab, skates
and mixes music.

57
00:01:45,924 --> 00:01:49,129
Lollo, 16, takes photos
and makes everyone

58
00:01:49,179 --> 00:01:50,038
look great.

59
00:01:50,088 --> 00:01:52,096
Be brave and send
in creative pages!

60
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:53,438
AI or by hand?

61
00:01:53,488 --> 00:01:55,448
You decide, both
are equally good.

62
00:01:55,498 --> 00:01:57,633
You stay the authors,
the AI only makes

63
00:01:57,683 --> 00:01:58,342
suggestions.

64
00:01:58,410 --> 00:01:59,967
And this isn't just
for this class.

65
00:02:00,017 --> 00:02:01,862
Every class at the
school can use the

66
00:02:01,912 --> 00:02:03,208
website for its own party.

67
00:02:03,258 --> 00:02:05,358
You're the first, and
what you learn helps

68
00:02:05,408 --> 00:02:05,858
everyone.

69
00:02:05,930 --> 00:02:08,107
Question A: Who
approves changes before

70
00:02:08,157 --> 00:02:08,998
they go online?

71
00:02:09,450 --> 00:02:11,415
Question B, really
important: photos.

72
00:02:11,465 --> 00:02:13,767
Photos only go up
with the yes of the

73
00:02:13,817 --> 00:02:16,243
person in them, and
if you're under 16,

74
00:02:16,293 --> 00:02:18,348
your parents have
to say yes too.

75
00:02:18,810 --> 00:02:20,788
Question C: Who checks
submitted photos

76
00:02:20,838 --> 00:02:21,801
before they appear?

77
00:02:22,250 --> 00:02:24,580
Question D: Which
pages do we want?

78
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:25,714
You can tick several.

79
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:28,442
Question F: Who can
send requests to the

80
00:02:28,492 --> 00:02:29,064
AI helper?

81
00:02:29,530 --> 00:02:32,097
Question G: What
happens after the party?

82
00:02:32,147 --> 00:02:33,800
Does the site stay
up, or does it get

83
00:02:33,850 --> 00:02:34,203
deleted?

84
00:02:34,650 --> 00:02:36,680
Question H: Who gets
onto the site, and

85
00:02:36,730 --> 00:02:37,981
who is in the committee?

86
00:02:38,031 --> 00:02:39,084
You can tick several.

87
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,826
Question I: How do
we want to build?

88
00:02:41,876 --> 00:02:44,098
With voice, with
a finger, or both?

89
00:02:44,570 --> 00:02:46,511
Question J: How do
we get your parents'

90
00:02:46,561 --> 00:02:47,058
agreement?

91
00:02:47,108 --> 00:02:48,487
Without it, no photos.

92
00:02:48,930 --> 00:02:49,778
Everything ticked?

93
00:02:49,828 --> 00:02:51,422
Then tap Submit.

94
00:02:51,472 --> 00:02:53,431
Your answers are
anonymous, and for now

95
00:02:53,481 --> 00:02:55,038
they stay only
in your browser.

96
00:02:55,730 --> 00:02:56,732
A few house rules.

97
00:02:56,782 --> 00:02:58,698
One: nothing mean
about others.

98
00:02:58,748 --> 00:03:00,081
Two: nothing private.

99
00:03:00,131 --> 00:03:01,754
Three: no photos
without a clear yes.

100
00:03:01,804 --> 00:03:03,533
Stick to that, and
everyone has fun.

101
00:03:03,583 --> 00:03:05,891
Teachers and parents
find the full rules

102
00:03:05,941 --> 00:03:08,249
in a separate video
at the bottom of the

103
00:03:08,299 --> 00:03:08,594
page.

104
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:10,466
You'll answer the
questions right below.

105
00:03:10,516 --> 00:03:12,902
I wish you all the
best and a really great

106
00:03:12,952 --> 00:03:13,298
party.

107
00:03:13,348 --> 00:03:14,070
See you soon!

